  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HyVpPan.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"660\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cwqwNx3TGE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/574476444366012420?label=Discord&color=252a36&labelColor=5865F2&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mandalacreations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mandalacreations&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&color=252A36&labelColor=FF424D&logoColor=FFFFFF\" width=\"196\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/CesarZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/follow-@cesarzorak-white?label=follow&color=252a36&labelColor=1D9BF0&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"213\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>關於：</strong></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p>\n<p>Fantasy Ores 改善了原版 Minecraft 礦石的體驗，讓遊戲更加精彩。<br>靈感源自《Hytale》，但融入了我的個人風格。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>特色：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>3D 礦石。</li>\n<li>3D 黑曜石與哭泣的黑曜石。</li>\n<li>3D 紫水晶簇。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>若想關閉「閃亮礦石」效果，請刪除壓縮包內的「optifine」資料夾。<br>模組支援，請點擊這裡：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fantasy-ores-modded-by-cesarzorak\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fantasy Ores Modded</a> ❤<br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;如果你喜歡我的像素藝術風格，也歡迎試試：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-perspective\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's - 透視視角</a> [相容於多個版本的 Minecraft、其他材質包與模組]<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode/files/4474251\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's - Veganicon</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode/files/4474251\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;快捷欄</a> [需手動下載並複製]<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-brewing-guide-on\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's - 釀造指南顯示</a> [原版]<br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's 介面 - 深色模式</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-white-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's 介面 - 白色模式</a><br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fantasy-ores-by-cesarzorak\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fantasy Ores by CesarZorak<br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fantasy-ores-modded-by-cesarzorak\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fantasy Ores by CesarZorak</a>&nbsp;[模組版]</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4r5WLBc.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"300\"></a><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>💝 親愛的贊助者 💝</strong> <strong>💝</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><em>請記得您可以在官方 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mandalacreations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala Creations Patreon</a></span> 支持我們，那裡會有即將推出的更新資訊。<br>這有助於我們為您帶來最佳品質。</em></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EjFOwtq.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"550\"></p>",
